  "body": "Dream location, elevated position and wide harbour views, this is an opportunity that offers so much more than meets the eye.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 885m² of elevated land in Mixed Housing Urban, this substantial property presents exciting options to renovate, recreate or explore future development possibilities, subject to the necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nThe existing home provides a generous three-bedroom layout with two separate living areas, including both formal and family living, plus a separate dining room. Downstairs, the garage and ample storage add practicality and versatility.\r\n\r\nBut it’s the outlook and location that truly set this property apart. Enjoy wide harbour views and the incredible lifestyle that comes with being just minutes from the ever-popular Kohimarama Beach.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate being zoned for Kohimarama School and Selwyn College, while the surrounding cafés, beaches, parks and local amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking to create your dream home, renovate and add value, or unlock the potential of this substantial site, this is a rare opportunity in a highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
